        <headline>Gale Warning issued September 24 at 4:05AM AKDT until September 25 at 5:00AM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK</headline>
        <description>Offshore waters forecast for the Gulf of Alaska West of 144W

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TODAY...SW wind 10 to 25 kt. Seas 5 ft.
.TONIGHT...S wind 20 to 35 kt. Seas 6 to 11 ft. Rain.
.FRI...S wind 15 to 30 kt. Seas 7 to 12 ft. Rain showers.
.FRI NIGHT...SW wind 15 to 25 kt. Seas 10 to 14 ft.
.SAT THROUGH SUN...SW wind 25 kt. Seas 9 to 14 ft.
.MON...W wind 20 kt. Seas 5 to 9 ft.
</description>
